"person","person_id":"ym8_q7g_031","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0181","surface":"太子登","start":181,"end":184,"kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0187","surface":"權","start":187,"end":188,"kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0200","surface":"壹","start":200,"end":201,"kind":"person","person_id":"ym8_q7g_031","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0208","surface":"權","start":208,"end":209,"kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0219","surface":"袁禮","start":219,"end":221,"kind":"person","person_id":"y6f_dyl_sdi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0244","surface":"諸葛瑾","start":244,"end":247,"kind":"person","person_id":"lpo_z63_vzb","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0248","surface":"步騭","start":248,"end":250,"kind":"person","person_id":"snv_2iq_jes","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0251","surface":"朱然","start":251,"end":253,"kind":"person","person_id":"tut_0t1_tb8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p092:m0254","surface":"呂岱","start":254,"end":256,"kind":"person","person_id":"2oe_qam_pq4","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-047","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan-ws2602668"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-047-sun-quan:p093","text":"袁禮還，雲與子瑜、子山、義封、定公相見，並以時事當有所先後，各自以不掌民事，不肯便有所陳，悉推之伯言、承明。伯言、承明見禮，泣涕懇惻，辭旨辛苦，至乃懷執危怖，有不自安之心。聞此悵然，深自刻怪。何者?夫惟聖人能無過行，明者能自見耳。人之舉措，何能悉中，獨當己有傷拒眾意，忽不自覺，故諸君有嫌難耳。不爾，何緣乃至於此乎？自孤興軍五十年，所役賦凡百皆出於民。天下未定，孼類猶存，士民勤苦，誠所貫知。然勞百姓，事不得已耳。與諸君從事，自少至長，發有二色，以謂表裡足以明露，公私分計，足用相保。盡言直諫，所望諸君，拾遺補闕，孤亦望之。昔衞武公年過志壯，勤求輔弼，每獨歎責。且布衣韋帶，相與交結，分成好合，尚污垢不異。今日諸君與孤從事，雖君臣義存，猶謂骨肉不復是過。榮福喜戚，相與共之。忠不匿情，智無遺計，事統是非，諸君豈得從容而已哉?同船濟水，將誰與易?齊桓諸侯之霸者耳，有善管子未嘗不歎，有過未嘗不諫，諫而不得，終諫不止。今孤自省無桓公之德，而諸君諫諍未出於口，仍執嫌難。以此言之，孤於齊桓良優，未知諸君於管子何如耳?久不相見，因事當笑。共定大業，整齊天下，當復有誰?凡百事要所當損益，樂聞異計，匡所不逮。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":109,"last_line":109,"raw_start":20055,"raw_end":20686,"raw_character_offsets":[20063,20064,20065,20066,20067,20068,20069,20070,20071,20072,20073,20074,20075,20076,20077,20078,20079,20080,20081,20082,20083,20084,20085,20086,20087,20088,20089,20090,20091,20092,20093,20094,20095,20096,20097,20098,20099,20100,20101,20102,20103,20104,20105,20106,20107,20108,20109,20110,20111,20112,20113,20114,20115,20116,20117,20118,20119,20120,20121,20122,20123,20124,20125,20126,20127,20128,20129,20130,20131,20132,20133,20134,20135,20136,20137,20138,20139,20140,20141,20142,20143,20144,20145,20146,20147,20148,20149,20150,20151,20152,20153,20154,20155,20156,20157,20158,20159,20160,20161,20162,20163,20164,20165,20166,20167,20168,20169,20170,20171,20172,20173,20174,20175,20176,20177,20178,20179,20180,20181,20182,20183,20184,20185,20186,20187,20188,20189,20190,20191,20192,20193,20194,20195,20196,20197,20198,20199,20200,20201,20202,20203,20204,20205,20206,20207,20208,20209,20210,20211,20212,20213,20214,20215,20216,20217,20218,20219,20220,20221,20222,20223,20224,20225,20226,20227,20228,20229,20230,20231,20232,20233,20234,20235,20236,20237,20238,20239,20240,20241,20242,20243,20244,20245,20246,20247,20248,20249,20250,20251,20252,20253,20254,20255,20256,20257,20258,20259,20260,20261,20262,20263,20264,20265,20266,20267,20268,20269,20270,20271,20272,20273,20274,20275,20276,20277,20278,20279,20280,20281,20282,20283,20284,20285,20286,20287,20288,20289,20290,20291,20292,20293,20294,20295,20296,20297,20298,20299,20300,20301,20302,20303,20304,20305,20306,20307,20308,20309,20310,20311,20312,20313,20314,20315,20316,20317,20318,20319,20320,20321,20322,20323,20324,20325,20334,20335,20336,20339,20340,20341,20342,20343,20344,20345,20346